{"c":"TWLO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"The markets for our products continue to evolve and may decline or experience limited growth.","source":"TWLO-0001447669-25-000035","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-26","proof":"8e1df159d8b5f943bbf3eb3d2b6254a211e630a0815bed7e7df2df389e905de0"},"TWLO.q.riskgone.2":{"c":"TWLO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"If our goodwill or intangible assets become impaired, we may be required to record a significant charge to earnings.","source":"TWLO-0001447669-25-000035","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-26","proof":"89dcc49ea5ff0bc3d5c6ea81f24aa827e03b2c43f22099c1c494761a1a95893c"},"TWLO.q.riskrw.0":{"c":"TWLO","kind":"risk","quote":"We may not be able to develop new products or product enhancements that achieve market acceptance, or adapt and respond effectively to rapidly changing technology, regulations, industry standards, or customer needs and preferences.","source":"TWLO-0001447669-26-000021","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-02-24","proof":"c523c0df532f72b45a522a8142621c8f07f4520173b704fde6090ba21335d78f"},"TWLO.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"TWLO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Our future success depends, in part, on our ability to develop new products and product enhancements that achieve market acceptance, as well as adapt and respond effectively to rapidly changing technology, regulations, and industry standards.","source":"TWLO-0001447669-25-000035","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-26","proof":"063e924a48057e31740285e35524916916a1d6669a65546de9b5abf2bb36208f"},"TWLO.q.riskrw.1":{"c":"TWLO","kind":"risk","quote":"The current and prospective markets for our products are intensely competitive and rapidly evolving, and if we do not compete effectively or if these markets fail to grow as expected, our business, results of operations and financial condition could be harmed.","source":"TWLO-0001447669-26-000021","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-02-24","proof":"a7aba997e8712c6210214dfac28d5b52c116ec5b6ed1a7a937a35c2ec4631869"},"TWLO.q.riskrwwas.1":{"c":"TWLO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"The markets in which we participate are intensely competitive, and if we do not compete effectively, our business, results of operations and financial condition could be harmed.","source":"TWLO-0001447669-25-000035","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-26","proof":"e9602f2d3b44c88bd46d6d11b9942dba0c401d69ba583c8ca647ec45ef168be4"},"TWLO.q.riskrw.2":{"c":"TWLO","kind":"risk","quote":"If we are unable to attract new customers or increase usage of our products by existing customers effectively and in a cost-efficient manner, our business, results of operations and financial condition would be adversely affected.","source":"TWLO-0001447669-26-000021","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-02-24","proof":"6b2e04db5bcc7d046cbe2d57b8c865dc8f7e7ad06383002d326a012246ec07e8"},"TWLO.q.riskrwwas.2":{"c":"TWLO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"If our sales and marketing efforts do not attract new customers or we are unable to sell additional products to our existing customers effectively and in a cost-efficient manner, our business, results of operations and financial condition would be adversely affected.","source":"TWLO-0001447669-25-000035","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-26","proof":"67f35f540e5a7f2a9d38bfbfae28a22efbda686d0ba6f57d8b2f8e7de435114f"},"TWLO.q.riskrw.3":{"c":"TWLO","kind":"risk","quote":"Changes in, or interpretations of, tax rules and regulations or our tax positions may materially and adversely affect our taxes.","source":"TWLO-0001447669-26-000021","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-02-24","proof":"8185d34c99a476da283df8979583d1edd4a7fdf95662e49f23e6dae962342738"},"TWLO.q.riskrwwas.3":{"c":"TWLO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Changes in, or interpretations of, tax rules and regulations or our tax positions may materially and adversely affect our income taxes.","source":"TWLO-0001447669-25-000035","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-26","proof":"e5f0b60f391b0ba392da7095f20e1fea46c6df